{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-91","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与比例与线段","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a first apotome, the side of the area is an apotome.","book":10,"number":91,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.91","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.91/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":91,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","contentId":"euclid-10-91","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b92b42da61612a924e0e68e2b7557d4cea9a237fb1854d67a714928662604915","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-91.statement","euclid-10-91.construction.1","euclid-10-91.proof.1","euclid-10-91.proof.2","euclid-10-91.proof.3","euclid-10-91.construction.2","euclid-10-91.proof.4","euclid-10-91.proof.5","euclid-10-91.proof.6","euclid-10-91.proof.7","euclid-10-91.proof.8","euclid-10-91.proof.9","euclid-10-91.proof.10","euclid-10-91.construction.3","euclid-10-91.proof.11","euclid-10-91.proof.12","euclid-10-91.proof.13","euclid-10-91.proof.14","euclid-10-91.proof.15","euclid-10-91.proof.16","euclid-10-91.proof.17","euclid-10-91.proof.18","euclid-10-91.proof.19","euclid-10-91.proof.20","euclid-10-91.proof.21","euclid-10-91.proof.22","euclid-10-91.proof.23","euclid-10-91.conclusion","euclid-10-91.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-91.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d7611a86c5a5a1bf1f6cf75d9ad8bbeb375b479f6daa3de416c498c12f88d0c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a first apotome, the side of the area is an apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第一个截差无理线段组成,则区域的另一侧为截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b3fb649896e17a336c54b3c54cf6a8177a908eb273c25a2349cb72631d967f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AB be contained by the rational straight line AC and the first apotome AD;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB区由有理线段 AC和前截差无理线段 AD组成;"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47bd11b27dae3fd30e0b59368ebfb5669f0df3b5d873086722433ff255818620","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the side of the area AB is an apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说AB区是截差无理线段区"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14c9da094c214aceefdd729f7cec6c9209983bdd5c92d0200c2b3582b44dab6a","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AD is a first apotome, let DG be its annex; therefore AG, GD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,AD是第一个截差无理线段,DG是其附件;因此,AG,GD是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3087a37baa63e3944c3a5fef59ecf9db71cfcb6d2f0b1beef12a1524b9e30b9d","citations":["euclid-10-def-11","euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the whole AG is commensurable with the rational straight line AC set out, and the square on AG is greater than the square on GD by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with AG; [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)] if therefore there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on DG and deficient by a square figure, it divides it into commensurable parts. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"整个AG为有理线段为可公度,AG为正方形为正方形为GD为正方形为长度可公度为AG为正方形为正方形为正方形为有理线段为AG为AG为平行四边形为正方形为正方形为平行四边形为DG为正方形为正方形为正方形为正方形为GD为正方形为AG为平行四边形为平行四边形为平行四边形为正方形为正方形为正方形为（相关点与线段：AC） [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)] [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2d36eed5f680f47b5c0112fc1b1811a2e9e2da93ee30fc888740c3899a1655f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let DG be bisected at E, let there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the square on EG and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle AF, FG; therefore AF is commensurable with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG两部分为E,对AG/平行四边形适用,等于EG正方形正方形,有正方形正方形不足,矩形、AF,FG矩形,AF可公度和FG可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c57e3d0baecc1f3e0ddd713e409937e238431868e68060263a977332b63b9cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And through the points E, F, G let EH, FI, GK be drawn parallel to AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E,F,G,EH,FI,GK 与AC平行"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"da62d5a1a03fd65c5d0d0cbba921a38ff6732052a7a9d6de7dd6cfea8d395629","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AF is commensurable in length with FG, therefore AG is also commensurable in length with each of the straight lines AF, FG. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AF是长度可公度,FG,AG也是长度可公度,每条直线AF,FG。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94869ca5ff218c7d8dffa0a24e46f114e566f95d17f182474a8c27c63831edd0","citations":["euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AG is commensurable with AC; therefore each of the straight lines AF, FG is commensurable in length with AC. [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AG是可公度,AC,AF,FG直线各是长度可公度,AC直线各是AC。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d79894c2e7c78f65cc0543931d7df612e62b537dcb73dee458ebd79c1de10c86","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AC is rational; therefore each of the straight lines AF, FG is also rational, so that each of the rectangles AI, FK is also rational. [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC是有理,因此,AF,FG直线各是有理,矩形,FK直线各是有理。（相关点与线段：AI） [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fb519d0bd27557cdb383828864dff431d4e9bc923312f16c68b27ad1ba33715","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since DE is commensurable in length with EG, therefore DG is also commensurable in length with each of the straight lines DE, EG. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,DE是长度可公度,EG,DG也是长度可公度,每条直线DE,EG。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75da6a0a5eb3056dd670a11fe5bcae849413821a8c1a5e967339a692b56f1ec0","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DG is rational and incommensurable in length with AC; therefore each of the straight lines DE, EG is also rational and incommensurable in length with AC; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] therefore each of the rectangles DH, EK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DG线长为有理,不可公度长为AC;因此,DE直线的每条长为DE,EG长为有理,不可公度长为AC;因此,矩形直线的每条长为中项无理线段,EK长为中项无理线段。（相关点与线段：DH） [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15ea0185a5dfdf1552acf1c42716ba5867e04a221bf118212fa32fd8dafa41ff","citations":["euclid-6-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square LM be made equal to AI, and let there be subtracted the square NO having a common angle with it, the angle LPM, and equal to FK; therefore the squares LM, NO are about the same diameter. [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,正方形 LM等于AI, 并减去正方形 NO, 其角度相同, 角度LPM, 等于FK; 因此, 正方形 LM, NO 直径大致相同。 [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":13,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72802f1b081a1ac963339b24e8028c256c6eb4278fd7cbc008025d669220eb2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let PR be their diameter, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让PR是直径, 让图绘制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71bb9813f1d7fc573000b796522b2952bed19d1510f2cb265e5d6832b656c0c3","citations":["euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the rectangle contained by AF, FG is equal to the square on EG, therefore, as AF is to EG, so is EG to FG. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AF组成的矩形,FG等于EG的正方形,因此,AF与EG的比等于EG与FG的比；AF 与 EG 之比等于 EG 与 FG 之比。 [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fd36fd53dd85bcd77664a1031936cca9a876392873f93b8699898ec6a570a61","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AF is to EG, so is AI to EK, and, as EG is to FG, so is EK to KF; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore EK is a mean proportional between AI, KF. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AF对EG的比等于AI对EK的比,EG对FG的比等于EK对KF的比,因此,EK对AI对KF的比是比例中项对AI对KF；AF 与 EG 之比等于 AI 与 EK 之比；EG 与 FG 之比等于 EK 与 KF 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5eaba58bf07757630fecb677dea710f09e5acedd96aea1b5af84cd2cf12f616a","citations":["euclid-10-53"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MN is also a mean proportional between LM, NO, as was before proved, [[Lemma after X. 53](/principles/euclid-10-53)] and AI is equal to the square LM, and KF to NO; therefore MN is also equal to EK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但如以前证明的那样,MN也是LM,NO之间比例中项,AI相当于正方形,LM相当于KF,NO等于EK,MN也等于EK。 [[引理 after X. 53](/principles/euclid-10-53)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf551e4f248fa7ab164ad64e5b5ed9f77427671540c3e3209069b223fe45bef2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EK is equal to DH, and MN to LO; therefore DK is equal to the gnomon UVW and NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EK等于DH,MN至LO;因此,DK等于曲尺形 UVW和NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2adbe7e0fa2d3131ba2b93f3514b1ad48945810842f3f9c94d0844cb6f1b666e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AK is also equal to the squares LM, NO; therefore the remainder AB is equal to ST."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AK美元也等于正方形 LM,NO美元;因此,其余AB美元等于ST美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6da5ed5d85bb7401b10a7fc1311383447c1a607d9cc6b02dea6abe96d36f4e62","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But ST is the square on LN; therefore the square on LN is equal to AB; therefore LN is the side of AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ST是LN的正方形,LN的正方形等于AB,LN是AB的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c118624993f80a3fe45db44d9c4ef722858e7a78bb1885d076258bf4ef19301","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that LN is an apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说LN是截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07eef51295198e5523cf2ae5e5646d6ab2f3ed13caa5374b3be416daa57c7a02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since each of the rectangles AI, FK is rational, and they are equal to LM, NO, therefore each of the squares LM, NO, that is, the squares on LP, PN respectively, is also rational; therefore each of the straight lines LP, PN is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为矩形 AI,FK是有理, 等于LM, NO, 因此,正方形,LM,NO,即分别是LP,PN, 也是有理;因此,LP,PN直线也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93524c03f01ca24e678c77eed3388e871cd3a15b944db7eb1547d523fcd7845e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DH is medial and is equal to LO, therefore LO is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DH为中项无理线段,相当于LO,因此LO也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efec1e8c52ead13976894140ca826e6d2c72b8d04ea771b8e85e7ebfc2aae561","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then LO is medial, while NO is rational, therefore LO is incommensurable with NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,LO为中项无理线段,NO为有理,因此,LO为不可公度,NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"666c5d949b280b1c92b6dea09c0d67e266376fb573d3cbd44ec5e20b33900255","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as LO is to NO, so is LP to PN; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore LP is incommensurable in length with PN. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,LO比NO等于LP比PN,因此,LP比LO等于PN；LO 与 NO 之比等于 LP 与 PN 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05361a2df43e99fa6cc3d94eca806461377d7457a773128b79fc08b75457a5ad","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore LP, PN are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore LN is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,LP,PN是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,LN是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"947c9a8ed2d480ed59042300816e0f929f0001e14f1f234d37ab7685a2349cf5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is the side of the area AB; therefore the side of the area AB is an apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这是AB区的一面, 因此AB区的一面是截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":27,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-91.source","contentId":"euclid-10-91","revisionId":"euclid-10-91@raw-b92b42da61612a92","order":28,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e2c08d8aa5f354f81a3fcefd6f38328dc1804fc12c68d39baff50cd990048d7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.91/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1